  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5d7254d0-63ce-4027-8cf8-62ebc8ac9aaf.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Cosmoocat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/976428cc3628909cd4b82eeadfa96012a4acc87a.png\" alt=\"yt\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/34Wy4VmD9m\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cb29e96bf480ff4df0c955440ca77e289b5b3613.png\" alt=\"ds\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fhttps%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fgalospheric-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/62ad04189ed2708a39eb8f72fb3caf1acf6a4d20.png\" alt=\"cf\"></a></p>\n<p>本模組新增了 Galosphere 與 Farmer’s Delight 之間的相容性。</p>\n<p>我們知道 NoCube 的 Galosphere Delight，但它已長時間未更新且存在錯誤。因此我們決定開發自己的附加模組。所有貼圖均由我們繪製，並嘗試加入原創概念。</p>\n<h2>物品</h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><ul><li>銀錘</li><li>Lumiere 塵粉</li><li>Lumiere 派</li><li>Lumiere 派切片</li><li>Lumiere 紙杯蛋糕</li><li>Allurite 塵粉</li><li>Allurite 派</li><li>Allurite 派切片</li><li>Allurite 紙杯蛋糕</li><li>紫水晶塵粉</li><li>紫水晶派</li><li>紫水晶派切片</li><li>紫水晶紙杯蛋糕</li><li>幻光柱</li><li>幻光醬汁</li><li>粉鹽塵粉</li><li>鹹魚</li><li>杜鵑花瓣</li><li>地衣蟲草捲</li><li>繁茂三明治</li><li>薄膜漢堡</li><li>鹹焦糖</li><li>鹹焦糖蛋糕</li><li>鹹焦糖蘋果</li><li>雞湯蘋果</li><li>紫水晶粉水果</li><li>閃光米雞肉排</li><li>洞穴披薩</li><li>洞穴烤肉串</li></ul><p><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_eb1bc3cd-89d6-4226-9a5e-b6da9752e146.png\" alt=\"\"></p></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>方塊</h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><ul><li>地衣蟲草木箱</li><li>金色地衣蟲草木箱</li><li>Lumiere 塵粉袋</li><li>Allurite 塵粉袋</li><li>紫水晶塵粉袋</li><li>粉鹽塵粉袋</li><li>鹹焦糖磚</li><li>雕刻鹹焦糖磚</li></ul><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2de529e3-3a49-4d75-97fc-6eba71742671.png\" alt=\"\"></p></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>